---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Shows
titleEs: Shows
permalink: /shows/
seoTitle: Card Shows & Trade Days in Las Cruces, NM
seoTitleEs: Shows de cartas y Trade Days en Las Cruces, NM
description: Upcoming and past Southwest Card & Collectible Shows and Trade Days in Las Cruces and Mesilla, NM. Free entry, 145+ tables, giveaways all day.
---
<section class="page-hero wrapper">
  <p class="kicker" data-i18n="shows.kicker">Free entry · Every time</p>
  <h1 class="glow" data-i18n="shows.title">Shows &amp; Trade Days</h1>
  <p class="lede" data-i18n="shows.lede">Big convention-center shows with 145+ tables, plus laid-back Trade Days with public seating, raffles and pizza.</p>
</section>
<section class="wrapper section">
  <h2 class="section-title"><span data-i18n="shows.upcoming">Upcoming</span></h2>
  {% set up = collections.events | upcoming %}
  {% if up.length %}
  <div class="event-grid">{% for event in up %}{% include "components/event-card.njk" %}{% endfor %}</div>
  {% else %}
  <p class="center"><span data-i18n="shows.none">Next date coming soon —</span> <a href="{{ business.social.discord }}" data-i18n="shows.joinToHear">join the Discord to hear first.</a></p>
  {% endif %}
</section>
{% set old = collections.events | past %}
{% if old.length %}
<section class="wrapper section">
  <h2 class="section-title"><span data-i18n="shows.past">Past events</span></h2>
  <div class="event-grid">{% for event in old %}{% set past = true %}{% include "components/event-card.njk" %}{% endfor %}</div>
</section>
{% endif %}
